{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34717","headline":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平去声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平去声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌蟾俱沈光，昼夜恨暗度。\n何当乘云螭，面见上帝愬。\n臣言阴云欺，诏用利劒付。\n回车诛羣奸，自散万籁怒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}